Package: ssCRCsim
Title: Single-Sample Colorectal Cancer REO Scoring and CMS Prediction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zy", "H", email = "2025020446@hrbmu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates colorectal cancer-specific transcriptional similarity
    scores based on relative expression orderings (REOs) and predicts
    consensus molecular subtypes (CMS1-CMS4) using a fixed, balanced
    CMS-specific REO rule panel constructed at a 73 percent consistency
    threshold. Both functions operate on individual expression profiles
    without requiring a patient reference expression matrix at prediction time.
